            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">OneUptime Cloud</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Usage-based: $0.10 per GB of telemetry ingested, with retention you control per vCenter. The vcenter receiver polls once every two minutes by default, so even a large vCenter produces a modest, predictable volume. No per-host, per-socket, per-core, or per-VM licence — grow the cluster without calling sales.</p>
            <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="h-4 w-4 text-indigo-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>Unlimited vCenters, hosts, and VMs</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="h-4 w-4 text-indigo-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>Per-vCenter retention settings to tune the bill</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="h-4 w-4 text-indigo-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>On-call, status pages, and incidents included</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/pricing" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700">See pricing <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5" /></svg></a>
