            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Self-Hosted</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">OneUptime is open source. Run the whole platform — VMware product included — on your own Kubernetes cluster or Docker host, keep every metric inside your network, and pay nothing for ingestion. The agent points at your instance's <code class="text-xs bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">/otlp</code> endpoint instead of ours; everything else is identical.</p>
            <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="h-4 w-4 text-indigo-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>Air-gapped and data-residency deployments supported</li>
